# Delivery and debug artifacts
artifacts/debug/
artifacts/releases/**/*.apk
artifacts/releases/**/*.aab
artifacts/releases/**/*.zip

# Logs and temporary output
**/*.log
**/*.out
**/*.pid
**/.tmp-*
**/tmp/
**/temp/

